# All knobs at both ends (modal ignores filter and resonance), the lowest and highest notes (C9: only its lowest
# partials are below 0.45 fs), velocity 1, knob jumps every step while notes start and steal, a full bend on glass.
tempo 120
steps 16
tail 0.5
track lead
preset 255 255 0 0 255 0 0 0 0 255 128 255 0 0 0 0 0 0
note 0 C0 4 127
note 0 C9 4 127
param p1 0 2
param p2 0 2
note 4 C2 4 1
param p1 255 5
param p2 191 6
param p1 0 7
param p2 255 7
note 8 G6 4 127
note 8 G6 4 127
note 8 G6 4 127
param p1 128 9
param p2 0 10
param p1 255 11
param p2 255 11
bend 12 200
note 12 C8 4 127
expect peak_below -3
